# F4: the film frame from start to finish.  1 starts; a tap on Space skips
# each card.  Scene 1 cleared on take 1 (clear.keys: $90 with the bonus),
# "THAT'S A PRINT!", the next card; then three crashes into the drums (no
# jumps): "CUT!", the card with the next take, and after the third "YOU'RE
# FIRED!"; $90 makes the top five, so initials: B, O, X, Del, B, then Return
# (Bob, BUILD 17: three letters don't end it; Return does); back to the title.
